  "title": "Hide Balance",
  "description": "Showing or Hiding Your BalanceUsers can toggle their balance visibility by tapping the balance or the eye icon.\nThis feature lets you conc...",
  "body": "<p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Showing or Hiding Your Balance</b><br>Users can toggle their balance visibility by tapping the balance or the eye icon.</p><p class=\"no-margin\">This feature lets you conceal your balance in public or whenever you prefer to keep it private.</p><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\">When the balance is <b>visible</b>, the eye icon displays a slash through it.</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">When the balance is <b>hidden</b>, the eye icon appears fully visible, and the balance is replaced with bold dots</p></li></ul>",
  "author_id": 9849332,
  "state": "published",
